outube.com/vi/zZ0whXKvPmE/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">ASUS has one of the coolest features I could imagine for a motherboard, the ASUS ROG Strix B850-E Gaming Wi-Fi. This is actually the ONLY feature I wanted to see. This is ASUS AI Advisor. An analog of Siri, but for... motherboard settings. Including an explanation of the BIOS features.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The new model is better in almost everything. It's 99% better. And it's so much better that I wanted it for myself.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/LEcr1VtyhVk/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">The new model is better in almost everything. It's 99% better. And it's so much better that I wanted it for myself.</p></div></li></ul></div> <ul class=\"ProductAwardVideo__awardVideoMoreContainer__hZyzH\"><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__ove