RogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(2)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI ProductAwardMedia__mediaItemLessThanThree__UaUrc\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Root Nation\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202105181822545800091.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      This particular assistant, on the ASUS ROG Strix B850-E Gaming WiFi motherboard, is the most important AI product I've seen from component manufacturers (with the exception of NVIDIA).\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Root Nation\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>03/22/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-E GAMING WIFI media of Root Nation\" href=\"https://root-nation.com/ua/soft-ua/apps-ua/ua-asus-ai-advisor-review/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemLessThanThree__grj9N\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Overclockers.ua\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202010262126295620585.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      As ASUS ROG Strix B850-E Gaming WiFi testing has shown, it's not a problem for it to overclock the Ryzen 9 9900X, and the available functionality is enough even for a chiller (cooling is the deterrent, not the motherboard).\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Overclockers.ua\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>01/29/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B850-E GAMING WIFI media of Overclockers.ua\" href=\"https://www.overclockers.ua/ua/motherboard/asus-rog-strix-b850-e-gaming-wifi/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></